  "$comment": [
    "Every string-capable property of esm-schema.json, classified for load-time metaparameter substitution (esm-spec 9.7.6).",
    "Checked by scripts/check-metaparameter-substitution-fields.py (run by scripts/test-conformance.sh); each binding's test suite compares its skip table and name-keyed map table to `skip_keys` and `name_keyed_map_keys` here.",
    "Paths are <Def>.<property>, with [] for array items, {} for map values, |i for the i-th oneOf/anyOf/allOf alternative, and (root) for the top-level document object.",
    "`skip_keys` and `name_keyed_map_keys` are DERIVED; print them with `scripts/check-metaparameter-substitution-fields.py --derive` after editing a classification."
  ],
